WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:16.589
Sid found Rex and Sara.

2
00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:19.606
"No apples," he said.

3
00:00:19.607 --> 00:00:23.561
"But I got berries."

4
00:00:23.562 --> 00:00:26.457
Rex looked at the berries.

5
00:00:26.458 --> 00:00:29.881
"They will be good!" he said.

6
00:00:29.882 --> 00:00:33.905
"Yummy!" Sara said.

7
00:00:33.906 --> 00:00:37.370
Then she looked around.

8
00:00:37.371 --> 00:00:43.120
"Where's Tor?" Sara asked.

9
00:00:43.121 --> 00:00:48.708
"Um . . . " Sid looked at the dirt.

10
00:00:48.709 --> 00:00:52.273
"Is something wrong?" Rex asked.

11
00:00:52.274 --> 00:00:55.997
"You seem upset," Sara said.

12
00:00:55.998 --> 00:01:00.994
Sid kicked a pebble.

13
00:01:00.995 --> 00:01:05.110
"Tor has a new friend," he said.

14
00:01:05.111 --> 00:01:09.300
"They flew away together."

15
00:01:09.301 --> 00:01:11.784
Sara shrugged.

16
00:01:11.785 --> 00:01:15.424
"Tor wanted to fly today."

17
00:01:15.425 --> 00:01:19.916
Sid sighed.

18
00:01:19.917 --> 00:01:24.235
"Tor likes flying dinos.

19
00:01:24.236 --> 00:01:28.577
Maybe she's not our friend anymore."

20
00:01:28.578 --> 00:01:32.457
"Don't be silly," Sara said.

21
00:01:32.458 --> 00:01:37.542
"Tor is still our friend!

22
00:01:37.543 --> 00:01:42.168
What happened, Sid?"

23
00:01:42.169 --> 00:01:46.343
"I made Tor walk," Sid said.

24
00:01:46.344 --> 00:01:51.750
"Then I was grumpy.

25
00:01:51.751 --> 00:01:55.264
I wanted apples."

26
00:01:55.265 --> 00:01:58.432
"Sid!" Rex got mad.

27
00:01:58.433 --> 00:02:02.858
"You made Tor fly away!"

